# pyenv
#   For a library or package, you might want to ignore these files since the Python version is individual.
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#119, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, if you're building something that isn't a package, you might want to ignore it.
#Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Using Poetry, it is generally recommended to check poetry.lock into version control.
#poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Using PDM, it is generally recommended to check pdm.lock into version control.
#pdm.lock

